Test-only OIDC fixtures for `tests/auth_oidc.rs` and `tests/process_oidc.rs`.

- `ed25519.pem`     private Ed25519 key, JWKS kid `test-1`
- `ed25519-2.pem`   private Ed25519 key, JWKS kid `test-2` (rotation case)
- `jwks.json`       public JWK set holding `test-1` only
- `jwks-rotated.json` public JWK set holding `test-1` and `test-2`

These keys are public in this repository. Never use them outside tests.
Regenerate with `openssl genpkey -algorithm ed25519`; the JWK `x` is the
base64url of the last 32 bytes of the DER public key.
